			"notes": "This update brings support for Minecraft 26.1.x - For modded servers, you'll need to download the correct JAR (fabric-1.21.x, neoforge-1.21.x or mod-26.1.x). Other servers (Spigot/Paper and proxies) still have a universal jar that supports every version and software.\n\nAdditionally, the plugin will show a warning and disable itself when used on a Waterfall server (since it doesn't provide the ServerLinks API) and commands have been fixed on modded servers.\n\nVisit the [wiki](https://lucaaa.gitbook.io/advancedlinks) for more information. If you encounter bug, please report it on [GitHub](https://github.com/Luncaaa/AdvancedLinks/issues) or Discord, not on the reviews section."
